{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Quality & Values",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Less Screen Addiction.<br><span>More Active Family Play.</span>" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "subhead", "label": "Subhead", "default": "You don't need another brittle gadget gathering dust. You need engaging, durable interactive entertainment that brings the entire family together." }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Trymalora Quality & Values" }]
}
{% endschema %}

<section class="zv-tabs-section">
  <div class="zv-tabs-container">
    <h2 class="zv-tabs-heading">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
    <p class="zv-tabs-sub">{{ section.settings.subhead }}</p>

    <div class="zv-tabs-nav" id="zvTabsNav">
      <button type="button" class="zv-tab-btn active" data-tab="1">Built for Active Play</button>
      <button type="button" class="zv-tab-btn" data-tab="2">Screen-Free Bonding</button>
      <button type="button" class="zv-tab-btn" data-tab="3">Certified Eye-Safe</button>
      <button type="button" class="zv-tab-btn" data-tab="4">30-Day Money-Back Guarantee</button>
    </div>

    <div class="zv-tabs-content">
      <div class="zv-tab-panel active" id="zvTabPanel1">
        <p><strong>Durable impact-resistant construction.</strong> Cheap knockoffs crack on the first drop. Every Trymalora product is molded from reinforced, non-toxic ABS polymer engineered to survive intense indoor chases, accidental drops on hardwood floors, and active multiplayer rounds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="zv-tab-panel" id="zvTabPanel2">
        <p><strong>Replace passive screens with real action.</strong> Get kids off phones, tablets, and gaming consoles. Trymalora brings dynamic, physical gaming into living rooms and hallways with responsive target projections, team scoreboards, and energetic full-body movement.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="zv-tab-panel" id="zvTabPanel3">
        <p><strong>100% eye-safe optical technology.</strong> Unlike high-power industrial lasers, Trymalora uses harmless diffuse infrared optical sensors—the same technology found in standard TV remotes—paired with safe LED illumination. Zero flying projectiles, zero mess, and complete peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="zv-tab-panel" id="zvTabPanel4">
        <p><strong>Put us to the test completely risk-free.</strong> Try any Trymalora set in your home for a full 30 days. If your family isn't completely thrilled with the excitement, laughter, and quality, contact our support team at support@trymalora.com for a swift, 100% hassle-free refund.</p>
        <div style="margin-top: 24px; text-align: center;">
          <a href="/products/kids-infrared-battle-blaster-set-with-target-projector" class="zv-btn-lime" style="background-color: #6B1E46; border-color: #6B1E46; color: #ffffff;">EXPLORE THE BATTLE SET →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  (function() {
    const nav = document.getElementById('zvTabsNav');
    if (!nav) return;
    const btns = nav.querySelectorAll('.zv-tab-btn');
    btns.forEach(btn => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        btns.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
        btn.classList.add('active');
        const tabNum = btn.getAttribute('data-tab');
        document.querySelectorAll('.zv-tab-panel').forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));
        const activePanel = document.getElementById('zvTabPanel' + tabNum);
        if (activePanel) activePanel.classList.add('active');
      });
    });
  })();
</script>
